  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">COVID-19 Recovery Project in the Philippines</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This project aims to help poor and vulnerable Filipinos recover from the physical, economic, educational, socio-emotional, and environmental effects of the COVID-19 pandemic. This will be achieved through the following project components:  1) Humanitarian Assistance for COVID-19 Affected Families &amp; Frontliners 2) Mental Health Sessions for Families and Communities 3) Community Pandemic Control Initiatives 4) Distance Learning Support for Learners 5) Livelihood Assistance for Communities</narrative>
  </description>
